        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Yale Grade 1 Commercial Pacific Beach Door Lever</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nYale Pacific Beach lever features a ADA compliant return to door design. It will fit doors with: 2-3/4 inch backset. It is adjustable for door from 1-3/8 inches to 1-3/4 inches thick.  \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nComplies with ANSI/BHMA A156.2-1996, Series 4000, Grade 1. Listed by UL / ULC for ratings of \u001cA\u001d  label (3 hours), UL10C / UBC 7-2 (1997) positive pressure, for single doors up to 4\u0019'0\"\u001d x 8'\u00190\"\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications:</b> for Yale Pacific Beach Levers\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Finish: Satin Chrome</li>\r\n<li>Grade 1 Lever</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable from 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backsets: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike: ANSI strike 4-7/8\" x 1-1/4\" x 1-1/4\" lip to center </li>\r\n<li>Latchbolt: 1/2\" stainless steel throw.</li>\r\n<li>Handing: Non-handed.</li>\r\n<li>Door Prep: Fits standard 161 door prep.</li>\r\n<li>Keyways: Para Keyway Standard. Schlage SC1 \"C\" Available by request. (for keyed functions).</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>PB4701LN: Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> Latchbolt operated by lever from either side at all times. For doors that don't need locking.</li>\r\n<li><b>PB4702LN: Privacy (Bathroom):</b> Latchbolt operated by lever from either side or emergency release in outside lever. Outside locked by push button on inside lever. Outside lever unlocked by emergency release in outside lever, rotating inside lever or closing door. </li>\r\n<li><b>PB4707LN: Keyed Entry:</b> Outside lever locked by push/turn button inside. When outside lever is locked by push button inside - key from outside or rotating inside lever unlocks outside lever. When outside lever is locked by pushing and turning the button inside - key from outside or rotating inside lever retracts the latch but does not unlock outside lever.\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
